      "content": "that's a great start, it definitely feels very grand. i want to make sure we really emphasize the idea that this was like a natural, necessary part of history. can you add more about how this expansion was basically an unavoidable destiny for the country, and maybe frame it as a triumph of civilization over the wilderness?",
